  "title": "Homemade Granola with Ginger",
  "description": "This homemade granola features crystallized ginger, nuts, seeds, oats, and a slew of spices, such as turmeric and cardamom, which add a sweet-spicy taste.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Rash"
  ],
